  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/uHWfIHb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"516\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>《Better Than Bunnies》的驕傲繼承者登場！Dapper Llamas 來讓你的世界更加華麗！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PPQP2lV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"516\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>完全收錄費茲帽與捲曲鬍子。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>模型部分由 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RazzleberryFox\" rel=\"nofollow\">RazzleberryFox</a> 製作並獲授权使用。服裝的各部件可獨立關閉，羊駝的華麗程度會隨機分配權重，帶來無數種不同的變化！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組僅支援客戶端。需安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a>。Fabric 版本請見 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-than-llamas-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Wyld/status/846489501320982528\" rel=\"nofollow\">#怪罪Wyld</a></p>",
